<title>ARMENIA: Armenia September unemployment unchanged at 9.8 pc.</title>
<headline>Armenia September unemployment unchanged at 9.8 pc.</headline>
<dateline>YEREVAN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people registered as unemployed in Armenia in September totalled 9.8 percent of the workforce, unchanged from the previous month, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> ARMENIA UNEMPLOYMENT	  Sep 96   Aug 96   Sep 95</p>
<p> percentage of workforce	9.8	9.8	n/a</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
